  "notes": [
    "vs.py names the vs.SetDropShadowData arguments and gives no unit codes. rect-shadow passes units 1 with a 2.5 offset, 1.5 blur, angle 315 and opacity 60. polygon-shadow passes units 0 with a 0.05 offset, 0.03 blur, angle 30 and opacity 85. The source census reads the stored kDropShadowNode (td101) fields, so the live run shows which unit code is world and which is page.",
